OpenRig — https://github.com/mvschwarz/openrig
Apache License 2.0

Designs adapted (no source code copied) in extensions/redplan.ts and hq/server.mjs:
  worker resume from a saved session file with --session, per-launch ids and
  explicit restore outcomes (pi-resume.ts, pi-runner-protocol.ts); required
  closure reasons, handoffs, and an append-only transition log
  (hot-potato-enforcer.ts, queue_transitions); parked-agent detection and the
  escalating wake ladder (agent-state-taxonomy.md, parked-query.ts,
  queue-wake-ladder.ts); the read-only restore check (restore-check-service.ts);
  team norms and the independent reviewer (specs/rigs/launch/*/CULTURE.md).

